Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has to be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, I don't see a soul anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me this became a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anybody\Nsay anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hope there's a well around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wishful thinking doesn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only makes the truth more painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right, the truth hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate being right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Land subsidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarnation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First the war dries up, then that dang\Ncriminal, the humanoid typhoon, shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town ain't fit to live in no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bash the stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The new hired gun at Saison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad times are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Meryl. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can get water from that mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.08,0:03:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the Cesar residence?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Merrill Stryfe,\Nand I'm here on behalf?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Bernardelli Insurance Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to you\Nfor a minute, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.58,0:03:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I'm her partner, Millie\NThompson, and we're very thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to ask you a few\Nquestions about Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that he was staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we certainly appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I work here now. I'm Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:04:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff's hired bodyguard, and\NI'm his exclusive ace gunman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.42,0:04:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that for me? How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really a bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're happy to see you\Nagain, Mr. Ace Gunman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an amazing coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I'd love one. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to keep your\Nmind on business, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Ace, I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your real reason for being here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that was an odd response.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I don't mean to interrupt you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but are these young ladies\Nfriends of yours, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any event, you two seem\Nto be here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be discussing this out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you please come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, but I don't think that we...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Cliff Cesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make my living selling\Nwater in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but recently somebody's\Nbeen trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could be bad for\Nbusiness and my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I advertise for a good bodyguard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for someone tough and smart\Nlike Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I originally put his name down as a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It never occurred to me\Nthat it would be taken
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seriously and that the real\Nthing would actually show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's me, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm here, you\Nhave nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who will slaughter the innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the most evil of\Nevil deeds with a price
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of 60 billion double dollars on his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice, dependable\Nguy, and modest as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Bash around, the people\Nof the mansion will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may sound rude, but I think\Nyou should have your eyes checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, young lady, it's very\Nimportant that I have a good bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me explain to you\Njust how important it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Marianne Alekhuizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the granddaughter of the\Nhead of the Stantal Federal Bureau,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she's staying at\Nthe mansion as my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, we had an attempted\Nbreak-in here five days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and frankly, I'm a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have hired a bodyguard if\NI thought they were coming after me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Marianne's safety\Nis my responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I do not want\Nanything happening to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now you know the whole story,\Nand that is why I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can definitely count on me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't let anyone in my sights get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm known for my bullets\Nnever missing their mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially if it's the\Nheart of a beautiful lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to have you protect me mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah A lot of people say\Nthat I hear it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Need to talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, my dear?\NListen to me, Mr. Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're a nice man
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you believe that weird guy\Nout there is Vash the Stampede,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the legendary gunman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That droopy-eyed, cocky,\Nupside-down-haired,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,women-chasing lunatic\Nwho's nuts for donuts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and gorges them like\Na starved hog in heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You honestly think it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's really very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She bought the donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's really very nice and loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am telling you for the last time,\Nyou are being deceived by that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I'm\Ndoing the deceiving. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you got a good look at the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that kind of mess out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all it took was a simple\Nlittle rumor that Vash
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Stampede was working\Nfor me as a bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The town folk panicked\Nand headed for the hills,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm expecting my enemy to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ad of yours caught my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:08:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of today, you are now\NVash the Stampede. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede, it's\Na pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have been anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a huge inconvenience,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but using him in your plan this\Nway makes a lot more sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, this whole thing's gone\Na lot farther than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scoundrel who's been\Nafter me is a tall, blond man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,packing a silver weapon and a\Nreputation as an ace gunfighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Millie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did. Every word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an absolute godsend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What humorous people they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's usually best just\Nto leave airheads alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you don't mind, My partner Millie and\NI would like to be your bodyguards too,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For extra protection\Nonly naturally we won't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demand to feel like that\Ngreedy faker over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there'd be no risk to you whatsoever?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that'd be fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not what I expected\Nto do as a bodyguard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every journey begins with a single step.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to have patience
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take it out when\Nit is wow scary later
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to show that guy something scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing has gone right since we met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's true at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having a wonderful time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, we get the hell to\Nall the water we can drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, has she got a short fuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear the sound of running water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I believe it's coming from\Nthe shower in Mary Ann's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lifeline secure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When favorable, the plan is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Marianne!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Marianne, the supper is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you doing\Nhanging outside the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh, well, diligently\Npatrolling the roof area for spooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it. Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bodyguards sure are busy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I almost forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supper's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Mr. Cliff's study.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marianne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, this place sure is fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is water really that profitable, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been a drought\Nfor the past few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very lucky to have been\Nable to enjoy a few luxuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because my father, who was a plant engineer,\Npurchased land with a water supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a rare commodity around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd imagine that would tend to\Nmake a lot of people jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm afraid a lot of\Nfolks want my water rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they think I'm monopolizing\Nit for selfish reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and don't want to share\Nthe wealth with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the water supply is not limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless it's managed properly by someone\Nwho knows how, it will completely dry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't change the fact that\Nyou're profiting from a natural resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, it's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're absolutely right, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't let the water be stolen by
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reckless people who don't\Ncare if it dries up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may call me a coward, but I intend\Nto do what it takes to protect the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's most admirable, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff, I'm not feeling very well I\Nthink I'm going to go to bed early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:12:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may look calm, but she's\Nprobably feeling quite ill at ease.?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was not such a\Ngood idea to invite her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I'll make the rounds\Nand make sure this place is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should at least pretend to\Nlook like a real bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an extra safety measure, I've asked\NMarianne to keep her curtain drawn. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.99,0:12:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never dream of\Ndoing anything like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very sensible idea, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really exhausted, Meryl, from\Nall the cooking we had to do today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling when\Nthe culprit will show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to be alert in our duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be no sleep for us tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:13:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One moment, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you looking at the stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though most of my memories\Nthere are unpleasant ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thoughts of home, whether good or bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are positive indicators\Nof a journey of the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always been my dream to travel\Nby myself to any place I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I could never persuade\Nmy father to let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I've only been allowed to stay\Nat the homes of his closest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is hardly what I'd call a\Njourney of the heart, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, you'll be able to take\Na journey to anywhere you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it may not\Nexactly be by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I understand\Nwhat you mean by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I just saw something move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go have a look. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my job, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt, you stupid idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! I'll sue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea who you're dealing with!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why the hell did you\Njust attack me, you maniac?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, it's only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, it's only me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marianne and I were having a\Nheated discussion about our
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,future when we were interrupted\Nby the sound of an intruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just came out to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what did I ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've apprehended the intruder,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you feel like you have\Na nice, clean conscience?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not when it comes to Marianne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, I had no idea the two\Nof you were on such friendly terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been paying any attention at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miss Marianne!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry your little head!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have captured the culprit, so\Nall is safe and well for you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling a culprit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both Miss Marianne and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff have just disappeared,\Napparently without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that they were kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were outside the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's pretty much impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so worried about them. Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nowhere to be found. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Marianne's dress\Nand some bloody bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a man that tried\Nto break in five days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we find a discarded dress\Nand some bloody bandages,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and finally Miss Marianne\Nwas seen sneaking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and entering Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff's study. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's more than enough evidence here to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,support the fact that\NMarianne has been after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marianne just isn't that kind of girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the moment I saw her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the look in her eyes, Miss\NMarianne has a beautiful heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the easily deceived type who cries\Nhimself to sleep every night, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot dream wrecker I know a ghost\Nmust have gotten Miss Marianne, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said yourself there were spooks on\Nthe roof when I saw you by the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was I mean, uh, what I\Nmeant was you know, spooks there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, spooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this about the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was hanging outside the window\Nby Miss Marianne's bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what the hell do\Nyou think you were doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peeking into a lady's\Nroom, you disgusting sicko!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.09,0:16:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may think you're slick, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hotpants, but you're not gonna\Nget away with it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time out! Time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he wasn't telling the whole truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a naughty little princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even pranks have a limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now they've started using\Nkids to do their dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your selfish\Nmonopolization of the water supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the land in this\Narea has dried up and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how many people\Nhave suffered because of your greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So little Miss Marianne\Ncomes to get the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice doesn't come that cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people have all evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there'll be no witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spreading the rumor of Vash the stampede\Ndid my business a world of good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have far too much invested\Nin this place to allow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the likes of you to come\Nin and ruin things for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot is that what he meant\Nwhen he said he was gonna sneak
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up behind him, this mess has\Ngone from spill to overflow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great under these conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely nothing we can do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Well, this explains\Nyour little luxuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting my time here. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:18:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the girl I thought you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He reads the trajectories of the bullets\Nby watching the gun movements and timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just no skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your bodyguard and his\Ngunman, just as advertised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:19:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was right after\Nall when I chose to hire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As requested, I have\Nprotected your guest, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job, Meryl! We did it! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dammed water just overflowed\Nall at once, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will return underground eventually\Nand make the town prosper again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure everyone who left will\Nbe able to return to their homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it was was a series of\Nlucky accidents, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you dodge all those\Nbullets just by accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did you do it on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it was more\Nlike a fluke, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if you did that consciously, I'm\Nafraid I'd really have to believe that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are, in fact, the\Nlegendary Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what if I was Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'd arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the both of you to thank as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be glad it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job's completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we've just\Ngone back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Meryl, don't let it get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My job's done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes the bodyguard with no name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could really fall for that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is completely irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you have no\Neye for men. Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.10,0:22:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe someday I'll show\Nyou, then you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no desire\Nto see, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Meryl, don't let it get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so sure it would work out this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was such a Kaite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess there's no\Nway it could have worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one will probably\Nbe blamed on me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.12,0:22:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blue sky in the sky, the\Nwind is coming to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.56,0:24:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who make mistakes blame\Nthemselves and close their hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to fix\Nthe mistake. Men can't
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.06,0:24:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,return to the past that's\Nwhy they drink luscious
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.56,0:24:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drunks sliding alcohol\Ndown their throats to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.58,0:24:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dilute the memories\Nthat can't be forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.68,0:24:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frank Marlin the gunsmith does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.16,0:24:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.07,0:24:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he questions the\Nglass after it's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.10,0:24:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I wrong?

